 terms.', 'Defects improved from 2,260 ppm to 980 ppm over the same period, which supports the supplier’s case.', 'The forecast rose from 450 to 2,390 units per year across the snapshots, indicating potential volume that may support the supplier’s case.', 'No rival quotes or supplier-specific prices are provided, so the data does not verify a competitive price advantage.']}}
